# Play-mode test runner garbage: Unity writes InitTestScene<random-guid>.unity into
# Assets/ on every -runTests pass and does not always clean it up. Never version these.
unity/Assets/InitTestScene*

# Stray nested Unity project: a player build (Tbilisi.app) plus its own 1.2 GB Library
# that got written to unity/Tbilisifly/ instead of build/. Pure output, never version it.
unity/Tbilisifly/
